<title>UK: Reckitt surges to fresh highs on bid talk.</title>
<headline>Reckitt surges to fresh highs on bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Reckitt and Colman Plc surged to fresh highs on Wednesday on a renewed bout of bid speculation and further reaction to a recent &quot;add&quot; recommendation from NatWest Securities, traders said.</p>
<p>Reckitt shares were up 21p at 835p by 1017 GMT.</p>
